  <content>
    <section>
      <para>Tell which line is the best fit for the data and give an explanation why it is the best fit.</para>
      <para>
        <figure>
          <media alt="TWO SCATTER PLOTS WITH X-AXIS LABEL OF INDEPENDENT VARIABLE AND Y-AXIS LABEL OF RESPONSE VARIABLE. SCATTER PLOT ON THE LEFT SHOWS FIVE PLOTTED POINTS AND THE LINE Y EQUALS NEGATIVE NINE-TENTHS X PLUS FORTY-FIVE. SCATTER PLOT ON THE RIGHT SHOWS THE SAME PLOTTED POINTS AND THE LINE Y EQUALS NEGATIVE SEVEN-TENTHS X PLUS FORTY.&#10;">
            <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_04_04_01.jpg"/>
          </media>
        </figure>
      </para>
    </section>
